    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superbly positioned in the heart of the historic coastal village of Killala, 18 Seaview Terrace is a charming three-bedroom, two-bathroom end-of-terrace home within easy walking distance of the village and its everyday amenities. Extending to approximately 74 sqm, the property offers bright, well-presented accommodation with views towards Killala Bay from the upper floor. What truly sets this home apart, however, is the exceptional outdoor space to the rear, an unusually long, private garden with covered and open-air entertaining areas, creating a wonderful extension of the home and a real hidden gem in such a convenient village setting.\n\nOne of the standout features of 18 Seaview Terrace is the remarkable outdoor space to the rear. Extending well beyond what might be expected from a village property, the exceptionally long and private garden incorporates a covered outdoor area immediately to the rear of the house, together with patio space ideal for alfresco dining and entertaining, before opening onto an extensive lawned garden beyond. This wonderful outdoor space provides enormous versatility for family life, gardening, recreation or simply relaxing and enjoying the outdoors.\n\nKillala is a historic and picturesque coastal village situated along Mayo's spectacular Wild Atlantic Way. Renowned for its landmark Round Tower, attractive harbour and strong sense of community, the village offers an enviable coastal lifestyle with shops, schools, cafés and everyday amenities close at hand, while the surrounding North Mayo coastline provides an abundance of beaches, shoreline walks and breathtaking Atlantic scenery.\n\nCombining a convenient village location with comfortable three-bedroom accommodation and an exceptional rear garden, 18 Seaview Terrace offers an exciting opportunity for those seeking a permanent home, coastal retreat or investment property in this beautiful part of County Mayo.\n\nFeatures:\n\nThree-bedroom, two-bathroom end-of-terrace residence\nApprox. 74 sqm of living accommodation\nWalking distance to Killala village and local amenities\nViews towards Killala Bay from the upper floor\nBright, well-presented accommodation throughout\nModern, fully tiled family bathroom\nExceptionally long and private rear garden\nCovered outdoor area directly to the rear\nPatio area ideal for alfresco dining and entertaining\nExtensive lawned garden\nExcellent outdoor space for family life, recreation and gardening\nConvenient location along Mayo's Wild Atlantic Way\nEasy access to the North Mayo coastline and nearby beaches\nOil central heating & solid fuel stove\nBroadband\nMains water/sewage\n\nRequest your digital brochure"
      },
